<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%">
<meta name="google-site-verification" content="XI667C_XftVJeeog3C-geo2RzDdxFFCuc9EMoDfOnEs" />



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Celebrating 100 Years of Educating Everyone</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Since 1926, TJC has empowered generations of students to discover their purpose, pursue their goals, and make a lasting impact across East Texas and beyond. As we celebrate 100 years, we honor the students, faculty, staff, alumni, and supporters who shaped the College’s rich history and enduring legacy. From classrooms and campuses to careers and communities, the TJC story is one of innovation, resilience, and excellence. Join us as we commemorate a century of Apache pride and look ahead to the future of TJC!</p>



<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-b192c3d7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button is-style-secondary"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://tjc.edu/tjc-centennial/">Learn More About TJC&#8217;s Centennial Celebration</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<div  style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div  style="height:20px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<section  class="home-intro">
	<div  class="home-intro__content">
					<h2>
									<span>The door to <strong>YOUR</strong> future is</span>
													<strong>always open.</strong>
							</h2>
		
					<div class="home-intro__text">
				<p style="font-size: x-large;">At TJC, we’re more than a college—we’re your partner in success.</p>
<p style="font-size: x-large;">Choosing college is a big step, and we’re here to make it easier. Whether you’re just getting started or planning your next move, our team is ready to support you, answer your questions, and help turn your goals into reality.</p>
