<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Share YOUR TJC Story</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">As Tyler Junior College celebrates 100 years of changing lives and serving East Texas, we invite alumni, students, employees, retirees, and friends of the College to help us tell the TJC story.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Whether you spent one semester here or built a lifelong connection with TJC, your memories matter. We’re collecting written stories, photos, and short video testimonials to share as part of TJC’s Centennial Celebration.</p>
</div>



