<h2 class="wp-block-heading">The College Tour visits TJC</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Alex Boylan, winner of CBS’s Amazing Race and&nbsp;host of <strong>The College Tour</strong>, shares the stories of 10 remarkable TJC students – past and present – each with a unique story about how TJC has prepared them for their careers and lives. </p>



